• the Athena Expense Cap not having been exceeded or, to the extent exceeded, the Sponsor having borne or repaid any amount in excess of the Athena Expense Cap;
• Athena having received a written waiver of any deferred IPO fees owed to Citigroup Global Markets Inc.; and
• Athena having entered into binding written agreements with the holders of any working capital loans (to the extent not included within the Athena Expense Cap) to convert the unpaid amounts to equity immediately prior to Closing, such that the equity dilution will be borne by either the Sponsor or Athena’s stockholders, but not Ace Green stockholders.", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, The Merger Agreement — Conditions to Closing of the Merger Agreement — Additional Conditions to Ace Green’s Obligations to Close, pages 77–78", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status": [{"quote": "We currently anticipate that we will consummate the Business Combination promptly following the special meeting, provided that all other conditions to the consummation of the Business Combination have been satisfied or waived.", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, Questions and Answers About the Business Combination, page xvii", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_description": [{"quote": "“Ace Green Common Stock” means the shares of common stock of Ace Green, par value $0.0001 per share.", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, Frequently Used Terms, page iv", "relevance_score": 5}], "effective_date": [], "available_options": [{"quote": "Each share of Ace Green Common Stock that is issued and outstanding immediately prior to the Effective Time (other than shares excluded pursuant to the Merger Agreement, and after giving effect to the conversion of Ace Green SAFEs into Ace Green Common Stock immediately prior to the Closing) will be canceled and converted into the right to receive (i) a number of shares of Athena Class A Common Stock (rounded up to the nearest whole share) equal to the quotient of (a) the Aggregate Merger Consideration divided by (b) the number of shares of Ace Green Fully Diluted Capital Stock and (ii) a pro rata share of the Earnout Shares.", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, The Merger Agreement — Conversion of Securities, page 73", "relevance_score": 5}], "default_option": [], "election_deadline": [], "merger_subsidiary": [{"quote": "On December 4, 2024, Athena, Project Atlas Merger Sub Inc., a Delaware corporation and a direct, wholly owned subsidiary of Athena (“Merger Sub”), and Ace Green Recycling, Inc. a Delaware corporation (“Ace Green”), entered into a Business Combination Agreement", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, Letter to Athena Technology Acquisition Corp. II Stockholders", "relevance_score": 5}], "cash_consideration_qualifications": [], "stock_exchange_ratio_type": [{"quote": "“Exchange Ratio” means a number equal to the quotient of (a) the quotient of (i) $250,000,000 divided by (ii) $10.10, divided by (b) the number of shares of Ace Green Fully Diluted Capital Stock.", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, Frequently Used Terms, page vi", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio_qualifications": [{"quote": "a number of shares of Athena Class A Common Stock (rounded up to the nearest whole share) equal to the quotient of (a) the Aggregate Merger Consideration divided by (b) the number of shares of Ace Green Fully Diluted Capital Stock", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, The Merger Agreement — Conversion of Securities, page 73", "relevance_score": 5}], "other_consideration": [{"quote": "New Ace Green will issue or cause to be issued to Ace Green Securityholders up to an aggregate of an additional 10,500,000 Earnout Shares (as adjusted)", "location": "ea0237057-04.htm, The Merger Agreement — Conversion of Securities, page 74", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Pursuant to the Merger Agreement, during the Earnout Period (a) New Ace Green will issue to the former Ace Green Securityholders an additional 3,500,000 Earnout Shares (as adjusted) and (b) the Sponsor will vest in and retain 500,000 Sponsor Earnout Shares (as adjusted), the first time each of the following occurs:
