ading days ending on the trading day three trading days prior to the day of the Closing Date", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | THE TRANSACTION AGREEMENTS, Merger Consideration, page 98", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "At Closing, the Reserve Shares, which represent 20% of the Merger Consideration Shares, will be reserved (out of Parent’s authorized capital stock) but not issued. The number of Reserve Shares to be issued to the SpinCo Holders post-closing, if any, will be based upon final determination of the purchase price.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | THE MERGER, Merger Consideration, page 88", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "the number of Additional Merger Consideration Shares will be capped at an amount equal to 20% of the Merger Consideration Shares.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | THE MERGER, Merger Consideration, page 88", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "No certificates or scrip representing fractional shares of Parent Common Stock or book-entry credit of the same shall be issued on conversion of SpinCo Common Stock", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | ANNEX A, Article III, Section 3.2(g), page 12", "relevance_score": 5}], "other_consideration": [], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "We anticipate that the Merger will be consummated during the first half of 2026, soon after the Jet.AI Special Meeting to be held on [ ], 2026, but we cannot predict the exact timing.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE TRANSACTIONS, page 18", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On February 11, 2026, the parties executed Amendment No. 4 to the Amended and Restated Agreement and Plan of Merger and Reorganization to eliminate the closing condition that would have required Jet.AI to execute a new securities purchase agreement with a third-party investor, pursuant to which Jet.AI would have issued the investor a warrant to purchase up to $50 million worth of shares of a newly-designated series of preferred stock of Jet.AI. Additionally, Amendment No. 4 permitted Jet.AI to explore and negotiate potential transactions, provided that any such transaction must be (i) conditioned upon the closing of the Transactions, and (ii) consummated after the consummation of the Transactions.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | THE MERGER, The Background of the Transactions, page 92", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "On January 13, 2026, the parties executed Amendment No. 3 to the Amended and Restated Agreement and Plan of Merger and Reorganization to extend the outside date from December 31, 2025 to April 30, 2026.", "location": "flyx-20260316.htm | THE MERGER, The Background of the Transactions, page 92", "relevance_score": 5}]}

