atory approvals and satisfaction of other closing conditions, including approval by our stockholders of the Transaction Proposal, we anticipate that the Merger will be completed by mid-2026.", "location": "PREM14A, QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE SPECIAL MEETING, THE HOLDING COMPANY MERGER, THE SEPARATION, AND THE MERGER, page 22", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_description": [{"quote": "each share of CE Holdings common stock (formerly Enviri common stock) that is outstanding immediately prior to the Effective Time", "location": "PREM14A, THE MERGER AGREEMENT—Treatment of Enviri Common Stock, CE Holdings Common Stock, and Enviri LTI Awards, page 86", "relevance_score": 5}], "effective_date": [], "available_options": [{"quote": "In the Merger, each share of CE Holdings common stock (formerly Enviri common stock prior to the Holding Company Merger) outstanding immediately prior to the Effective Time (other than Excluded Shares) will be automatically exchanged for the Merger Consideration, without interest and less any applicable withholding taxes.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—Treatment of Common Stock and Common Stock-Based Awards, page 14", "relevance_score": 5}], "default_option": [], "election_deadline": [], "merger_subsidiary": [{"quote": "all references to “Merger Sub” refer to Liberty Merger Sub Inc., a Delaware corporation and wholly owned indirect subsidiary of Veolia", "location": "PREM14A, SUMMARY, page 10", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Immediately after the Distribution, Merger Sub will merge with and into CE Holdings, with CE Holdings surviving the Merger as an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of Veolia (the “Merger”).", "location": "PREM14A, PRELIMINARY PROXY STATEMENT—SUBJECT TO COMPLETION, page 3", "relevance_score": 5}], "cash_consideration_qualifications": [{"quote": "The Merger Agreement provides that each share of CE Holdings common stock (which was Enviri common stock prior to the Holding Company Merger) that is issued and o