• no action shall be pending which is reasonably likely to (i) prevent consummation of any of the Transactions, or (ii) cause any of the Transactions to be rescinded following consummation, and no order to any such effect shall be in effect since the date of the Merger Agreement, no material adverse effect with respect to Allegro shall have occurred and be ongoing;
