eration shall be distributed by Midco to our equityholders (including the Affiliated Entities) in the form of CVRs.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—Effect of the Merger on Midco Common Stock, page 68", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The Merger Consideration will consist exclusively of the right to receive the Milestone Payment Amount.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—No Cash Payment for Common Stock in the Merger, page 69", "relevance_score": 5}], "shareholder_vote_date": [{"quote": "Notice is hereby given that the 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders, or the Annual Meeting, of Senti Biosciences Holdings, Inc., or the Company, we, us, or our, will be held online on August 18, 2026 at 8:00 a.m. Pacific Time.", "location": "PREM14A, Notice of 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "4.	To approve the Agreement and Plan of Merger and the Contemplated Transactions (as described below);", "location": "PREM14A, Notice of 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders", "relevance_score": 5}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "Section 8.01 Conditions to Each Party’s Obligation. The respective obligation of each party hereto to effect the Merger is subject to the satisfaction (or, to the extent permitted by applicable Law, waiver by the parties entitled thereto) on or prior to the Merger Closing Date of the following conditions:", "location": "PREM14A, Annex A—Merger Agreement, Section 8.01, page A-46", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "(a) No Legal Restraints. No Governmental Entity having jurisdiction over the Company, the Parent or Merger Sub shall have enacted or issued any Law, Judgment or other legal restraint (in each case, whether temporary, preliminary or permanent in nature) prohibiting the consummation of the Merger that is still in effect (any such Law or a Judgment, a “Legal Restraint”);
