he conditions set forth in the two bullet points immediately above have been satisfied.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—Conditions to Completion of the Merger, page 82", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status": [{"quote": "On July 14, 2026, the Company, Midco, Opco, Parent and Merger Sub executed the Merger Agreement. On July 15, 2026, the Company and Celadon issued a joint press release announcing the transaction.", "location": "PREM14A, Proposal No. 4—Background of the Merger, page 44", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "However, completion of the Merger is subject to the satisfaction or waiver of the conditions to the completion of the Merger, and factors outside the control of the Company or Parent may delay the completion of the Merger, or prevent it from being completed at all. There can be no assurances as to whether or when the Merger will be completed.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—When the Merger Becomes Effective, page 68", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_description": [{"quote": "Except as provided in Section 3.01(a)(ii), each share of Midco Common Stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the Closing Effective Time shall automatically be cancelled and converted into the right to receive the Milestone Payment Amount", "location": "PREM14A, Annex A—Merger Agreement, Section 3.01(a)(iii), page A-11", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "each outstanding share of Midco common stock (other than shares owned by Midco or a subsidiary of Midco, which shares will be canceled), will automatically be canceled and converted into the right to receive the Milestone Payment Amount", "location": "PREM14A, Proposal No. 4—Certain Effects of the Merger, page 32", "relevance_score": 5}], "effective_date": [], "available_options": [{"quote": "The Merger Consideration will consist exclusively of the right to receive the Milestone Payment Amount. The right to receive the Merger Consideration shall be distributed by Midco to our equityholders in the form of CVRs.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—No Cash Payment for Common Stock in the Merger, page 69", "relevance_score": 5}], "default_option": [], "election_deadline": [], "merger_subsidiary": [{"quote": "Senti Merger Sub, Inc., or Merger Sub, was formed on June 22, 2026, solely for the purpose of completing the proposed Merger", "location": "PREM14A, Summary—The Companies, page 1", "relevance_score": 5}], "cash_consideration_qualifications": [{"quote": "The CVRs represent only a contingent right to receive cash payments if and when one or more specified Milestones are achieved on or before the Milestone Expiration Date (the seventh anniversary of the date on which the closing of the Merger occurs). There is no guarantee that any Milestone will be achieved or that any payment will ever be made to holders of CVRs.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—No Cash Payment for Common Stock in the Merger, page 69", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "In no event will Midco be obligated to pay more than an aggregate of $60,000,000 in respect of all CVRs pursuant to the CVR Agreement, or the Aggregate Payment Cap, and no Milestone Payment Amount will be paid more than once with respect to the applicable Milestone:", "location": "PREM14A, The Contingent Value Rights Agreement—Milestone Payments, page 86", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Each Company Stock Option that is outstanding and unexercised as of immediately prior to the CVR Record Date shall entitle such holder to receive, upon exercise of such Company Stock Option pursuant to the terms thereof, a number of CVRs equal to the number of shares of Company Common Stock that would have been issuable upon exercise in full of such Company Stock Option immediately prior to the CVR Record Date, reduced by an amount equal to the amount of any applicable withholding Taxes, subject to and in accordance with the terms and conditions of such Company Stock Option and the CVR Agreement.", "location": "PREM14A, Annex A—Merger Agreement, Section 3.01(b)(ii), page A-11", "relevance_score": 3}], "stock_exchange_ratio_type": [], "stock_exchange_ratio_qualifications": [], "other_consideration": [{"quote": "The right to receive the Merger Consideration shall be distributed by Midco to the Company’s equityholders (including the Affiliated Entities) in the form of CVRs. Pursuant to the Merger Agreement, the Board of Directors or the Special Committee thereof shall approve and Midco shall effect the issuance and distribution of one CVR with respect to each share of the Company’s common stock (including shares of common stock held by the Affiliated Entities)that is issued and outstanding as of the CVR record date", "location": "PREM14A, The Contingent Value Rights Agreement—Merger Consideration, page 86", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The product of (a) the holder’s pro rata share and (b) $10,000,000 upon the filing by or on behalf of Midco, or any of its affiliates or licensees, of a Biologics License Application, or a BLA, with, and its acceptance, or the passing of the 60-day review period without rejection, by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, or the FDA, for the Logic Gated off-the-shelf CAR-NK cell therapy known as SENTI-202, or the Product (such Milestone, the BLA Milestone);", "location": "PREM14A, The Contingent Value Rights Agreement—Milestone Payments, page 86", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The product of (a) the holder’s pro rata share and (b) $20,000,000 upon the receipt by or on behalf of Midco or any of its affiliates or licensees of FDA approval of the BLA for the Product (such Milestone, the FDA Approval Milestone); and", "location": "PREM14A, The Contingent Value Rights Agreement—Milestone Payments, page 86", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The product of (a) the holder’s pro rata share and (b) $30,000,000 upon the achievement of cumulative worldwide net sales (as defined in the CVR Agreement) of the Product in excess of $200,000,000, during the period commencing on the first commercial sale of the Product until the Milestone Expiration Date (such Milestone, the Sales Milestone).", "location": "PREM14A, The Contingent Value Rights Agreement—Milestone Payments, page 87", "relevance_score": 5}], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "As of the date of the filing of this proxy statement, the parties expect to complete the Merger in the third quarter of 2026.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—When the Merger Becomes Effective, page 68", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On July 14, 2026, the Company, Midco, Opco, Parent and Merger Sub executed the Merger Agreement. On July 15, 2026, the Company and Celadon issued a joint press release announcing the transaction.", "location": "PREM14A, Proposal No. 4—Background of the Merger, page 44", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "However, completion of the Merger is subject to the satisfaction or waiver of the conditions to the completion of the Merger, and factors outside the control of the Company or Parent may delay the completion of the Merger, or prevent it from being completed at all.", "location": "PREM14A, The Merger Agreement—When the Merger Becomes Effective, page 68", "relevance_score": 5}]}

