ns and Answers About the Business Combination, page xiii", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On July 28, 2026, New PBT, New PBT Sub, OpCo, Blackbeard Holdings, Blackbeard Security and Greybeard Energy entered into the Combination Agreement.", "location": "S-4, Summary — The Business Combination and the Combination Agreement and the Exchange Agreement, page 2", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The Business Combination cannot be completed without, among other things, the approval of the Indenture Amendment Proposal by Unitholders.", "location": "S-4, Questions and Answers About the Special Meeting, page xv", "relevance_score": 5}]}

