t (the “Per Share Cash Consideration”) and (ii) 0.4735 shares of common stock (the “Per Share Stock Consideration”), par value $0.001 per share, of MiMedx (the “MiMedx Common Stock”) and, if applicable, cash in lieu of fractional shares, subject to adjustment as described in this proxy statement/prospectus and subject to applicable withholding taxes", "location": "PROPOSED MERGER — YOUR VOTE IS VERY IMPORTANT", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "In lieu of any fractional shares of MiMedx Common Stock to which a Sanara shareholder would otherwise have been entitled, each Sanara shareholder will receive an amount in cash, without interest, determined by multiplying such fraction by the closing price of a share of MiMedx Common Stock on Nasdaq on the last trading day immediately preceding the Closing Date (rounded to the nearest cent).", "location": "THE MERGER AGREEMENT — Effect of the Merger; Merger Consideration, page 65", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio_type": [{"quote": "Although the Per Share Stock Consideration is fixed, the market value of the stock component of the Merger Consideration will fluctuate with the market price of MiMedx Common Stock. Furthermore, the Per Share Stock Consideration may be subject to adjustment, as described in this proxy statement/prospectus.", "location": "PROPOSED MERGER — YOUR VOTE IS VERY IMPORTANT", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio_qualifications": [{"quote": "If, during the period between the date of this Agreement and the Effective Time, any change in the outstanding shares of capital stock of the Company or Parent shall occur, including by reason of any reclassification, recapitalization, stock split or combination, exchange or readjustment of shares, or any stock dividend thereon with a record date during such period, but excluding any change that results from any vesting, settlement or exercise of Company Restricted Stock or Company Options outstanding as of the date hereof, the Merger Consideration and any other amounts payable pursuant to this Agreement shall be appropriately adjusted to provide Parent and the holders of Company Stock (including holders of Company Restricted Stock and Company Options) the same economic effect as contemplated by Sections 2.2 and 2.6.", "location": "Annex A — Section 2.7 Certain Adjustments, page A-12", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "No fraction of a share of Parent Common Stock shall be issued as a result of or in connection with the Merger. In lieu of the issuance of any such fraction of a share to which a former holder of Converted Shares would otherwise be entitled, Parent shall pay to the Exchange Agent an amount in cash, without interest, determined by multiplying such fraction by the closing price of a share of Parent Common Stock on Nasdaq on the last trading day immediately preceding the Closing Date (rounded to the nearest cent).", "location": "Annex A — Section 2.3 Surrender and Payment, page A-11", "relevance_score": 5}], "other_consideration": [], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "We expect to complete the Merger in the fourth quarter of 2026.", "location": "QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE PROPOSED MERGER AND THE SPECIAL MEETING — When do you expect to complete the Merger?, page iv", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On July 29, 2026, each of the Merger Agreement and the Voting Agreement was fully executed by the applicable parties thereto. After market close on July 29, 2026, MiMedx and Sanara issued a joint press release announcing the execution of the Merger Agreement.", "location": "THE MERGER — Background of the Merger, page 41", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "We must first obtain the approval of the Merger Proposal from Sanara’s shareholders, as well as obtain necessary regulatory approvals and satisfy certain other closing conditions.", "location": "QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ABOUT THE PROPOSED MERGER AND THE SPECIAL MEETING — When do you expect to complete the Merger?, page iv", "