xchange Ratio.", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A—Business Combination Agreement, page A-9", "relevance_score": 5}], "default_option": [], "election_deadline": [], "merger_subsidiary": [{"quote": "MMR Merger Sub, Inc., a Delaware corporation and a direct wholly owned subsidiary of GigCapital7 (“Merger Sub”)", "location": "S-4/A, Notice of Extraordinary General Meeting—Proposal No. 1", "relevance_score": 5}], "cash_consideration_qualifications": [], "stock_exchange_ratio_type": [{"quote": "“Exchange Ratio” means the quotient of: (a) the Aggregate Merger Consideration; divided by (b) the Hadron Fully Diluted Capital.", "location": "S-4/A, Frequently Used Terms, page iv", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio_qualifications": [{"quote": "“Aggregate Merger Consideration” means the number of shares of Domesticated GigCapital7 Common Stock equal to the difference of: (a) the Aggregate Domesticated GigCapital7 Common Stock, minus (b) 13,333,333 shares of Domesticated GigCapital7 Common Stock; provided, however, that if Hadron Energy has any Indebtedness outstanding as of the Closing, the Aggregate Merger Consideration shall be further reduced by a number of shares of Domesticated GigCapital7 Common Stock equal to the amount of such Indebtedness divided by the Per Share Price (rounded down to the nearest whole share).", "location": "S-4/A, Frequently Used Terms, page iii", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The Per Share Merger Consideration and the Exchange Ratio shall be adjusted to reflect appropriately the effect of any stock split, reverse stock split, stock dividend, recapitalization, reclassification, combination, exchange of shares or other like change with respect to Domesticated Purchaser Common Stock occurring prior to the date the shares comprising the Per Share Merger Consideration is issued.", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A—Business Combination Agreement, Section 2.05, page A-12", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Any fractional shares of Domesticated Purchaser Common Stock will be rounded up to the nearest whole share of Domesticated Purchaser Common Stock, as applicable.", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A—Business Combination Agreement, Section 2.06, page A-13", "relevance_score": 5}], "other_consideration": [], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "It is currently expected that the Business Combination will be consummated in the first quarter of 2026.", "location": "S-4/A, Questions and Answers for Shareholders of GigCapital7—When do you expect the Business Combination to be completed?, page xxix", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "“Business Combination Agreement” means the Business Combination Agreement, dated as of September 27, 2025, by and among GigCapital7, Merger Sub and Hadron Energy, as it may be further amended, supplemented or otherwise modified from time to time in accordance with its terms.", "location": "S-4/A, Frequently Used Terms, page iii", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "On December 12, 2025, the parties entered into a first amendment to the Business Combination Agreement (the “First Amendment”), pursuant to which the parties expanded the size of the post-Closing Board of Directors to eight (8) members.", "location": "S-4/A, Notice of Extraordinary General Meeting—Proposal No. 1", "relevance_score": 5}]}

