eement—Consideration to be received in the merger, page 76", "relevance_score": 5}], "shareholder_vote_date": [{"quote": "USB shareholders are receiving this joint proxy statement/prospectus because, at the close of business on February 20, 2026, the record date for the special meeting of USB’s shareholders to be held at USB’s corporate office located at 2126 Inyo Street, Fresno, California 93721 at 2:00 pm PT on March 30, 2026, they owned shares of USB common stock, and the USB Board is soliciting proxies for the matters to be voted on at this special meeting, as described in more detail below.", "location": "communitywestbancshares-sx.htm, Information About the Special Meeting of USB Shareholders—Purpose, page 31", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "to approve the principal terms of the merger agreement, pursuant to which USB will merge with and into CWB, and the transactions contemplated therein;", "location": "communitywestbancshares-sx.htm, Information About the Special Meeting of USB Shareholders—Purpose, page 31", "relevance_score": 5}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "•approval of the merger agreement and the transactions contemplated therein at the USB special meeting, and approval of the issuance of CWB common stock pursuant to the merger agreement at the CWB special meeting;
