alue $0.001 per share, of Purchaser.", "location": "Annex A, Appendix A Defined Terms", "relevance_score": 5}], "shareholder_vote_date": [{"quote": "The Annual Meeting of ProCap’s stockholders will be held at 9:00 a.m. Eastern Time, on March 27, 2026 at https://www.cstproxy.com/procapfinancial/2026.", "location": "The Annual Meeting, page 11", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "If ProCap is to complete the merger with CFO Silvia, stockholders must approve Proposal 1.", "location": "The Annual Meeting, page 11", "relevance_score": 5}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "The completion of the Merger is subject to customary closing conditions, including but not limited to:
